xhytDJAIA5UBUxTGSy50pk0EHze-lotqJ2xaLbKhPQ2c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6YeioVjBFZLpO16p_pMmDc-ZxGXnx_jTBLFD3dIw_Pig&oe=6A185998"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Crane Ops - All in 1 Crane Simulator", "keywords": ["Cranes", "Training", "CraneSimulator", "SimulationGames", "Safety"], "long_description": "Experience the power of heavy machinery like never before.\n\nCrane Ops is an advanced VR Simulation Game that puts you in full control of a wide range of Industrial Cranes and Construction Machines from towering high-rise rigs to cmpact mobile units and forklifts.\nWhether you're a professional Operator, a Trainee, or simply fascinated by the mechanics of lifting and logistics, Crane Ops delivers a fully immersive, hands-on experience that combines real-world physics with rich, interactive environments.\n\nFeatures:\nOperate multiple crane types: Tower, Fork Lifter, Telescopic and more.\nRealistic Environments: Construction Sites, Ports, Warehouses, and Training Yards.\nAuthentic controls and real-life physics simulation.\nProgressive challenges and certification-style missions.\nBuilt for Gamers, Trainers, and Industry Professionals.\nStep into the Cab. Take the Controls. Master the Machinery.\nMultiplayer co-op modes for team-based logistics and crane coordination. (Coming Soon).", "short_description": "Crane Ops is the ultimate all-in-one VR Simulator for Crane and Heavy Machinery operations. Master tower cranes, mobile rigs, forklifts, and more all in hyper-realistic environments built for both Training and Immersive Gameplay."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"i